 "summary": "SQL/PSM (ISO/IEC 9075-4) is the standard procedural extension of SQL: stored procedures and functions, compound statements (BEGIN ... END), local variables, IF/CASE/LOOP/WHILE/REPEAT/FOR, cursors, condition handlers and SIGNAL/RESIGNAL; implemented closely by MySQL/MariaDB and Db2 SQL PL.",
